version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-05
repository-code: "https://github.com/eruannaarte/adelic-arithmetic-research"
url: "https://github.com/eruannaarte/adelic-arithmetic-research/releases/tag/transfer-theorem-v1-2026-09-05"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Proved query transfer through nuisance removal, finite approximation and
  restricted sensing, with structured clock and model uncertainty. Includes
  complete six-channel spatial certificates, infinite arithmetic clock blocks,
  verified degree-eleven and degree-twelve recovery budgets, actual-model
  reconstructions, independent internal reviews and a standalone interactive lab.
keywords:
  - inverse problems
  - uncertainty quantification
  - query recovery
  - validated numerics
  - reproducible research
